        <border color="rgba(94, 42, 42, 1)" width="0" />
        <content fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" />
      </shape>
      <shape width="600" height="32" topLeftX="62" topLeftY="26" type="text" id="bmF">
        <content textType="title" fontSize="24" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(38, 34, 29, 1)" bold="true" wrap="false">
          <p>关键机制：逐边调节与生态身份</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="188" height="18" topLeftX="724" topLeftY="34" type="text" id="bmf">
        <content textType="caption" fontSize="10" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(122, 116, 106, 1)" letterSpacing="1" textAlign="right" wrap="false">
          <p>03 · 评测协议与方法</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <line id="bmN" startX="48" startY="64" endX="912.0005787035097" endY="64">
        <border color="rgba(201, 192, 172, 1)" width="1" />
      </line>
      <line id="bmK" startX="480.00000000000006" startY="92" endX="480.0000000000001" endY="424.00150602068055">
        <border color="rgba(201, 192, 172, 1)" width="1" />
      </line>
      <shape width="400" height="18" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="92" type="text" id="bmC">
        <content textType="caption" fontSize="10" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(176, 122, 46, 1)" bold="true" letterSpacing="1.5" wrap="false">
          <p>机制一 · H2</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="408" height="28" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="114" type="text" id="bmd">
        <content fontSize="16.5" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(94, 42, 42, 1)" bold="true" wrap="false">
          <p>逐边调节：传递强弱不再一刀切</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="408" height="22" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="150" type="text" id="bmu">
        <content fontSize="12" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(70, 64, 56, 1)" wrap="false">
          <p>每条有方向的连接（j → i）的调节强度由河段物理量决定：</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="426" height="40" topLeftX="42" topLeftY="178" type="text" id="bmr">
        <content fontSize="13.5" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" textAlign="center">
          <p><formula><latex>g_{ij}=\mathrm{MLP}_{e}([\mathrm{hops}_{ij},\ell_{ij},\mathrm{ord}_{j},A_{j},s_{j}])</latex></formula></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="426" height="28" topLeftX="42" topLeftY="226" type="text" id="bmP">
        <content fontSize="13.5" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="center">
          <p><formula><latex>m_i=\sum_{j}g_{ij}W_{j\to i}h_j</latex></formula></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="426" height="16" topLeftX="42" topLeftY="254" type="text" id="bsG">
        <content fontSize="9.5" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(122, 116, 106, 1)" textAlign="center" wrap="false">
          <p>j 取遍 i 的上游邻域 N(i)，W 按边方向 j→i 选取</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <line id="bmD" startX="48" startY="278" endX="456.0012254883556" endY="278">
        <border color="rgba(228, 222, 209, 1)" width="1" />
      </line>
      <shape width="408" height="130" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="290" type="text" id="bme">
        <content fontSize="12.5" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(38, 34, 29, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.6">
          <p>· 调节依据：跳数、河段长度、河流分级、汇水面积、坡度</p>
          <p>· 逐边调节，距离远或不相关邻站的信息被压低</p>
          <p>· 上下游权重分开，保留「水往低处流」的方向含义</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="400" height="18" topLeftX="504" topLeftY="92" type="text" id="bmc">
        <content textType="caption" fontSize="10" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(176, 122, 46, 1)" bold="true" letterSpacing="1.5" wrap="false">
          <p>机制二 · H2X</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="408" height="28" topLeftX="504" topLeftY="114" type="text" id="bmU">
        <content fontSize="16.5" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(94, 42, 42, 1)" bold="true" wrap="false">
          <p>生态身份：回答「这是一条什么河」</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="408" height="22" topLeftX="504" topLeftY="150" type="text" id="bmp">
        <content fontSize="12" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(70, 64, 56, 1)" wrap="false">
          <p>把静态的汇水区属性整合成一段「河流身份」：</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="418" height="40" topLeftX="494" topLeftY="178" type="text" id="bmG">
        <content fontSize="13.5" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" textAlign="center">
          <p><formula><latex>e_i=\mathrm{MLP}_{c}([\mathrm{land}_i,\mathrm{clim}_i,\mathrm{soil}_i,\mathrm{hydro}_i])</latex></formula></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="418" height="40" topLeftX="494" topLeftY="226" type="text" id="bmS">
        <content fontSize="13.5" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" textAlign="center">
          <p><formula><latex>h_i^{0}=[x_i\Vert e_i]</latex></formula></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <line id="bmW" startX="504" startY="278" endX="912.0012254883557" endY="278">
        <border color="rgba(228, 222, 209, 1)" width="1" />
      </line>
      <shape width="408" height="130" topLeftX="504" topLeftY="290" type="text" id="bmv">
        <content fontSize="12.5" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(38, 34, 29, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.6">
          <p>· 四组生态属性：气候、水文、土地覆盖、土壤地形</p>
          <p>· 河流身份与逐月变化的特征结合，本身不随月份改变</p>
          <p>· 没监测过的站点，也能凭自身生态属性得到合理的初始判断</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <line id="bmO" startX="48" startY="436" endX="912.0005787035097" endY="436">
        <border color="rgba(216, 209, 192, 1)" width="1" />
      </line>
      <shape width="864" height="20" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="448" type="text" id="bml">
        <content fontSize="12.5" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(38, 34, 29, 1)" wrap="false">
          <p><strong><span color="rgba(94, 42, 42, 1)">逐项对照（E2b 平均绝对误差）　</span></strong>只留一组：气候 1.06 · 土地 1.05 · 水文 1.01 · 土壤地形 0.99；四组全用 0.96，各管一块、互不重复。</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="864" height="20" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="474" type="text" id="bmZ">
        <content fontSize="12.5" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(38, 34, 29, 1)" wrap="false">
          <p><strong><span color="rgba(94, 42, 42, 1)">分工　</span></strong>逐边调节回答信息「怎么传」，生态身份回答站点「是什么」；前者强在时间补全，后者强在向新站点推广。</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <line id="bmL" startX="48" startY="508" endX="912.0005787035097" endY="508">
        <border color="rgba(201, 192, 172, 1)" width="1" />
      </line>
      <shape width="520" height="16" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="514" type="text" id="bmT">
        <content textType="caption" fontSize="9" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(150, 143, 130, 1)" wrap="false">
          <p>逐项去掉单个机制即可量化其贡献（消融对照）</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="112" height="16" topLeftX="800" topLeftY="514" type="text" id="bmM">
        <content textType="caption" fontSize="9" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(150, 143, 130, 1)" textAlign="right" wrap="false">
          <p>11 / 18</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
    </data>
    <note id="bmh">
      <content>
        <p>这页讲两个关键机制。左边是 H2 的逐边调节：每条边传递信息的强弱由跳数、河段长度、河流分级、汇水面积和坡度算出，不再是不分远近的平均；消息只汇总上游邻站，上下游权重仍然分开。</p>
        <p>右边是 H2X 的生态身份：静态的汇水区属性先整合成一段「河流身份」，再和逐月变化的特征结合，这样完全没监测过的站点也有合理的初始判断。</p>
        <p>底部逐项对照显示四组生态属性各管一块、合起来最好；两个机制分工明确，一个管信息怎么传，一个管这是条什么河。</p>
      </content>
    </note>
  </slide>
  